### php-learn .gitignore
### IntelliJ / PHPStorm
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

### Composer 依赖（composer install 后会重建）
/vendor/

### 真实配置（含数据库密码，只提交 example 模板）
/config/config.php
/storage/
### 运行时数据
/logs/
/storage/session/
/storage/session/*
!/storage/session/.gitkeep

### 本地临时文件
*.log
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
